# The files that build, sign and deploy Chickadee (#3072). A change to any of
# them can reach production with no other review, so each one names an owner,
# and GitHub asks that owner to review every pull request that touches it.
#
# Review by the owner is not required today (the main ruleset needs no
# approval, so one maintainer can merge). Turning on "Require review from
# Code Owners" in the main-protection ruleset makes this file a gate.

/.github/                         @JimWallace
/deploy/                          @JimWallace
/Dockerfile                       @JimWallace
/docker-compose.yml               @JimWallace
/.dockerignore                    @JimWallace
/.trivyignore.yaml                @JimWallace
/scripts/bluegreen-deploy.sh      @JimWallace
/scripts/server-deploy.sh         @JimWallace
/scripts/snapshot.sh              @JimWallace
/scripts/restore.sh               @JimWallace
/scripts/assemble-release.sh      @JimWallace
/SECURITY.md                      @JimWallace
